From eafe07520bbae130ea1cf49abef83a895a5d637c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QC3284 <2078725082@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:08:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] zx279128s: link the image at the 0x47F00000 boot entry

The product boot chain does not run U-Boot at the address the A1 RAM-chain
port links it to. secondboot copies the payload to 0x47F00000 and calls it
with blx (reverse-engineering evidence, evidence/uboot-re-20261115.md),
while the A1 port links at 0x43000000 for the vendor-console tftp+go flow.

U-Boot is not position independent: CONFIG_POSITION_INDEPENDENT is off,
relocate.S computes its fixup delta as relocaddr - run_image_start and
assumes the run address equals the link address, and pre-relocation code
reads .rodata/.data at link-time addresses. Entering this image at
0x47F00000 would hang or data abort before the banner.

Link at 0x47F00000 instead, which is also where the vendor console loads it
from now on. The initial stack stays at 0x48000000 and the relocation
target is still computed from the top of DRAM, so the image and the stack
keep a wide gap.

Signed-off-by: QC3284 <2078725082@qq.com>
---
 configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631_defconfig b/configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631_defconfig
index 5bc3adb8..48cdef48 100644
--- a/configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631_defconfig
+++ b/configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631_defconfig
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@ CONFIG_SYS_DCACHE_OFF=y
 CONFIG_SYS_L2CACHE_OFF=y
 CONFIG_ARCH_ZX279128=y
 CONFIG_SUPPORT_PASSING_ATAGS=y
-CONFIG_TEXT_BASE=0x43000000
+CONFIG_TEXT_BASE=0x47F00000
 CONFIG_SYS_MALLOC_F_LEN=0x800
 CONFIG_NR_DRAM_BANKS=1
 CONFIG_HAS_CUSTOM_SYS_INIT_SP_ADDR=y
